# What a public export leaves behind.
#
# `git archive` honours these; the files stay in this repository, which is
# private. Nothing here is deleted or moved — the export simply does not
# carry it.

# 3372 Linux man pages, rendered to plain text. The man-pages project is a
# patchwork of GPLv2+, BSD and verbatim-only licences, and almost all of them
# require the notice to travel with the page. Rendering dropped those notices,
# so this set cannot be redistributed as it stands.
corpora/posix-api/ export-ignore

# musl libc headers, copied out of a cross-toolchain include directory. musl is
# MIT, but not one of these 215 files carries a notice and musl's COPYRIGHT is
# not here — and a toolchain include dir is not guaranteed to hold only musl's
# headers. Provenance first, then it can ship.
corpora/musl-headers/ export-ignore

# Build and download logs from one pod run. Evidence worth keeping, not source
# anyone needs to clone.
pod-artifacts-qwen3coder/ export-ignore
